{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Ascend the Dome",
    "steam_appid": 3451130,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3451130/extras/925062b89b0900f913086dc3dd21c717.avif?t=1752505664\" width=600 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Is this the hardest and most massive climb-up game ever made?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You find yourself trapped in a massive dome containing various biomes, each filled with unique obstacles and challenges. Your mission is to escape by climbing through the layers of the dome, facing numerous challenges, minigames, and puzzles that will test your precision and skill.<br>Designed for speedrunners, this is definitely <i>not</i> a cozy game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3451130/extras/dcb65f951b3e3cbdcd11f58ea733c8c5.poster.avif?t=1752505664\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3451130/extras/dcb65f951b3e3cbdcd11f58ea733c8c5.webm?t=1752505664\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3451130/extras/dcb65f951b3e3cbdcd11f58ea733c8c5.mp4?t=1752505664\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Climb, drive, dodge, roll, run, explore, swim, fly, grind... all to reach the top, combining climbing with unique minigames in every biome:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kart parkour levels.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Backrooms and mazes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Golf Rollin.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SkyBlock.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Puzzles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Physics-Based Challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Billard Rollout.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And much, much, much more!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3451130/extras/8b520d957f7e68be75fe04ae07eb7a6f.poster.avif?t=1752505664\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3451130/extras/8b520d957f7e68be75fe04ae07eb7a6f.webm?t=1752505664\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3451130/extras/8b520d957f7e68be75fe04ae07eb7a6f.mp4?t=1752505664\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 different gameplay styles based on your chosen challenge:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>STREAMER TWITCH</strong>:\u00a0<u>Connect your game to your Twitch channel</u>! Your chat can interact and mess with you using commands, subs, and bits! In return, you\u2019ll unlock character upgrades, and either you or your chat will have to choose between different options. How about a double jump in exchange for 5 subs?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SPEEDRUN</strong>:\u00a0Compete to reach the global top of the <u>Steam leaderboard</u>!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Time Trial</strong>: Reach the next checkpoint before the timer hits 0 to reset it. There's no time for falling!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Normal Mode</strong>: Do you like cozy games where you can relax by baking cakes? Well, in this game, you need to sit on the cake and... try to reach the top without losing control.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3451130/extras/49d0cf81632699f5e0582c982905ee44.poster.avif?t=1752505664\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3451130/extras/49d0cf81632699f5e0582c982905ee44.webm?t=1752505664\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3451130/extras/49d0cf81632699f5e0582c982905ee44.mp4?t=1752505664\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>ROGUELIKE:</u></strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find the 'lucky blocks' to get random temporary upgrades that will help you reach the top.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Along the way, you'll discover collectibles to unlock dashes, as well as checkpoints to save your progress at high altitudes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try to find the different shortcuts and secret portals scattered throughout the level to cut down your time to the finish line!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be patient and enjoy the journey!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3451130/extras/925062b89b0900f913086dc3dd21c717.avif?t=1752505664\" width=600 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Is this the hardest and most massive climb-up game ever made?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You find yourself trapped in a massive dome containing various biomes, each filled with unique obstacles and challenges. Your mission is to escape by climbing through the layers of the dome, facing numerous challenges, minigames, and puzzles that will test your precision and skill.<br>Designed for speedrunners, this is definitely <i>not</i> a cozy game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3451130/extras/dcb65f951b3e3cbdcd11f58ea733c8c5.poster.avif?t=1752505664\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3451130/extras/dcb65f951b3e3cbdcd11f58ea733c8c5.webm?t=1752505664\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3451130/extras/dcb65f951b3e3cbdcd11f58ea733c8c5.mp4?t=1752505664\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Climb, drive, dodge, roll, run, explore, swim, fly, grind... all to reach the top, combining climbing with unique minigames in every biome:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kart parkour levels.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Backrooms and mazes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Golf Rollin.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SkyBlock.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Puzzles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Physics-Based Challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Billard Rollout.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And much, much, much more!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3451130/extras/8b520d957f7e68be75fe04ae07eb7a6f.poster.avif?t=1752505664\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3451130/extras/8b520d957f7e68be75fe04ae07eb7a6f.webm?t=1752505664\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3451130/extras/8b520d957f7e68be75fe04ae07eb7a6f.mp4?t=1752505664\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 different gameplay styles based on your chosen challenge:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>STREAMER TWITCH</strong>:\u00a0<u>Connect your game to your Twitch channel</u>! Your chat can interact and mess with you using commands, subs, and bits! In return, you\u2019ll unlock character upgrades, and either you or your chat will have to choose between different options. How about a double jump in exchange for 5 subs?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SPEEDRUN</strong>:\u00a0Compete to reach the global top of the <u>Steam leaderboard</u>!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Time Trial</strong>: Reach the next checkpoint before the timer hits 0 to reset it. There's no time for falling!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Normal Mode</strong>: Do you like cozy games where you can relax by baking cakes? Well, in this game, you need to sit on the cake and... try to reach the top without losing control.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3451130/extras/49d0cf81632699f5e0582c982905ee44.poster.avif?t=1752505664\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3451130/extras/49d0cf81632699f5e0582c982905ee44.webm?t=1752505664\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3451130/extras/49d0cf81632699f5e0582c982905ee44.mp4?t=1752505664\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>ROGUELIKE:</u></strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find the 'lucky blocks' to get random temporary upgrades that will help you reach the top.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Along the way, you'll discover collectibles to unlock dashes, as well as checkpoints to save your progress at high altitudes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try to find the different shortcuts and secret portals scattered throughout the level to cut down your time to the finish line!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be patient and enjoy the journey!</p>",
    "short_description": "A 3D rage-climbing game where you have to escape by scaling up different domes all the way to the top. Face all kinds of parkour challenges that\u2019ll push your precision and skills to the limit! Connect your game to your Twitch chat!",
